Third-party components

This Skill bundles PyYAML and XlsxWriter under scripts/vendor/ so that it runs
without installing anything.

PyYAML 6.0.3 -- MIT License
https://github.com/yaml/pyyaml
Full text: references/licenses/PYYAML_LICENSE.txt

Modified from the original distribution: the file cyaml.py is removed. It
binds the optional libyaml C extension, which is not bundled. PyYAML's
__init__.py already handles the missing import and uses the pure-Python
parser. All other PyYAML files are unmodified.

XlsxWriter 3.2.9 -- BSD 2-Clause License
https://github.com/jmcnamara/XlsxWriter
Full text: references/licenses/XLSXWRITER_LICENSE.txt

Modified from the original distribution: the chart and chartsheet modules
are removed, because this Skill writes tabular sheets only. In
workbook.py and worksheet.py, Workbook.add_chart, Workbook.add_chartsheet and
Worksheet.insert_chart raise NotImplementedError, and one
isinstance(worksheet, Chartsheet) test is replaced by a read of the
worksheet's is_chartsheet attribute. Cell, format and file-writing behaviour
is unchanged. Modules not imported by this Skill are also removed.
